  "notes": "POS back-office dashboard for a coffee house. Distinctive: four KPI tiles each tinted a different pastel (mint, sky, butter, lavender) with matching tinted rounded icon chips; secondary metrics grouped into two long bordered strips divided into thirds; every widget card has a tinted icon chip next to its title and a blue 'View all ->' link. Electric blue #3248ff is the single brand color (active nav pill, Close day button, links, payment bars); the period segmented control uses a black pill for the selected option. Order statuses shown as colored text (amber Pending, blue Preparing, green Ready, grey Completed). Slim footer status bar shows user role, receipt printer connection and 'Shift opened' pill, typical of POS ops tools. Large radii (14-18px) and soft shadows. Date picker opens a native browser picker."
